\fs20\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1 MultiContacts allows you to work with several Contact Lists. 
\par Current release of EPOC\~Contacts application allows to have only one Contact List, MultiContacts makes it possible for you to work around the problem and maintain as many Contact Lists as you require. 
\par MultiContacts is a Shareware Application. If you find it useful, please Register the Software. Please refer to the chapter "}{\b\f1 Registration}{\f1 " of this ReadMe file.
\par }{\b\f1\ul Compatibility}{\f1 :
\par This program was tested on Psion Revo, Revo+, Series 5mx, 7, netBook and Diamond Mako. 
\par MultiContacts will not work on Psion Series 5, since its EPOC\~Release does not have Contacts Application (Epoc prior to 5).
\par }{\b\f1\ul Key Features of the Program are}{\f1 :
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1 \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 \'95\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\sa100\sl200\slmult0\widctlpar
