\nooverflow\faroman\ls3\rin0\lin360\itap0 {\b\f1 Data Safety.}{\f1  MultiContacts takes extra care when it comes to the safety of your Contact Lists. It uses "cautious" copy routines that make sure your files are not corrupt when moved around.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1 \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 \'95\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\sa100\sl200\slmult0\widctlpar
