\nooverflow\faroman\ls3\rin0\lin360\itap0 {\b\f1 Data Integrity.}{\f1   MultiContacts will never start two instances of itself. MultiContacts always makes sure Contacts application is not running. And, as an extra protection step, MultiContacts will even 
}{\b\i\f1 disable}{\f1  Contacts application when your Contact Lists are copied around or Recovery module is running.
